WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 072. ONE POLICY. MANY REALITIES. Islands experience access differently.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
PLACE. CHANGE THE PATH. Connect providers, transport, supply, infrastructure, and administration.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
COMPARE. SAME RULE. DIFFERENT CONSTRAINTS. Never flatten local barriers.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
CULTURE. DO NOT CLAIM AUTHORITY. Representation requires consent and relationship.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
BOUNDARY. MAP ≠ LAW OR CARE. Keep unknowns visible.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
SAVE. PRESERVE LOCAL DIFFERENCE. Access intelligence must remain place-aware.
